'''Funghi''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be obtainable during the [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]]. It can be unlocked from any of the stages in [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event#A Fungal Challenge|A Fungal Challenge]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 277
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Funghi
|name2 = Funghi 'n' Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Funghi 'n' Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Funghi is a pretty standard meatshield, low cost, fast recharge and practically non-existent health and attack, however, Funghi has one interesting stat that sets it apart: its range.

Funghi's higher than average range for a meatshield of 200 allows it to stack up behind your other meatshields, acting as a safety net for your ranged attackers incase the enemies manage to push through your other meatshields. This use is still very niche, as it only practically applies in stages where the main threats have low range and can't damage units past it with abilities like [[Long Distance]] or [[Wave Attack]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

